    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You grew up in a castle amid wealth, power, and privilege. Your family of minor aristocrats made sure you received an excellent education, parts of which you enjoyed and parts of which you resented. The time you spent in the castle, and especially the long hours watching your family at court, also taught you much about leadership.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.feats24.Item.phbftSkilled0000]{Skilled}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> History and Persuasion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesFine]{Fine Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPerfume0000]{Perfume}, 29 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
